[?2004l===== floor/notes =====
     1	Busy-floor note: some shifts invoke steep with an exclusive hold so the mill never shares the floor. The hold helper lives under /app/holdbay. Desk stalls that recover overnight often get blamed on overlap, not on a finished JSON object.
     1	Wall stamp for mill-local calendar sketches. Not the urn day field.
     1	Optional exclusive mill hold. Not on the pour/steep path unless wired in.
